      "writtenOn": "2022-11-30T06:47:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "EC_HOST_EVENT_THERMAL(11) will be sent in the following situations:\n1.[smi_sensor_failure_warning](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/thermal.c;l\u003d163?q\u003dsmi_sensor_failure_warning\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch:src%2Fplatform%2Fec%2F) : notify host that EC can’t read any temp sensors.\n2.[fan stalled](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/fan.c;l\u003d538?q\u003dEC_HOST_EVENT_THERMAL\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch:src%2Fplatform%2Fec%2F)\nEC_HOST_EVENT_THERMAL_THRESHOLD(9) will be sent in the following situations:\n1.[dptf thermal control](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/dptf.c;l\u003d168?q\u003dEC_HOST_EVENT_THERMAL_THRESHOLD\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch:src%2Fplatform%2Fec%2F)",
      "parentUuid": "cb857d8c_6c8c33bd",
      "range": {
